            "review_title": "Review at Vietnam Golden Buffalo Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Rob Nesbit\nWarsaw, Poland6958 contributions\n0\nSeen a rat dining out too\nOct 2022\nBit of a dive, the food was absolute horse shees.........one dish was the knuckles of chickens, or something silly like that - i didn't order it - the other dish was some dry, very crispy buffalo meat - yes buffalo - ha ha...... anyway both awful\n\nLeast the beers were cold...........and the price of 15 euros not too bad...\n\nSeen a rat dining out too, good on him Mr Ratty\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 1, 2022",
