            "review_title": "Review at Vietnam Golden Buffalo Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Inspire Life\n85 contributions\n0\nNice BBQ buffalo meat and other seafood\nMar 2019 • Friends\nFirst time I have tried the BBQ buffalo meat here and it is nice. Have some beers too, good combination for food enjoyment.\n\nIf you want to try some genuine taste of Vietnamese BBQ foods, this restaurant is good.\n\nYou cannot find the English restaurant sign board here. The Vietnamese restaurant name is TRAU VANG QUAN. The address is the same as in Trip Advisor.\n\nEnjoy!!!\nRead more\nWritten March 25, 2019",
